ghee encodes JPEG with the jpeg-encoder crate, which carries code ported from
the Independent JPEG Group's software. This software is based in part on the
work of the Independent JPEG Group.

ghee/examples/fonts/DejaVuSans-Latin.ttf, a subset of DejaVu Sans, travels
with the bundled examples. Its license is ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/PixelOperator8.ttf, Pixel Operator 8 by Jayvee Enaguas,
travels with the bundled examples, under CC0 1.0 Universal. Its text is
ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-PixelOperator.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/DepartureMono-Regular.otf, a subset of Departure Mono by
Helena Zhang, travels with the bundled examples, under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. Its text is ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-DepartureMono.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/LCDSeven-Bold.ttf, LCD Seven Bold, is a subset of DSEG7
Classic Bold by keshikan, renamed for its Reserved Font Name "DSEG". It travels
with the bundled examples, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Its text is
ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-DSEG.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/Silkscreen-Regular.ttf, a subset of Silkscreen by Jason
Kottke, travels with the bundled examples, under the SIL Open Font License
1.1. Its text is ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-Silkscreen.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/Bedstead.otf and Bedstead-UltraCondensed.otf, subsets of
Bedstead by Ben Harris and others, travel with the bundled examples, under CC0
1.0 Universal. Its text is ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-Bedstead.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/Monogram.ttf, a subset of monogram by Vinícius Menézio,
travels with the bundled examples, under CC0 1.0 Universal. Its text is
ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-Monogram.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/TitlePixel.ttf, Press Start 2P by CodeMan38 cut to
printable ASCII and renamed, as its Reserved Font Name requires, travels with
the bundled examples under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Its text is
ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-PressStart2P.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/NotoColorEmoji-karaoke.ttf, the two emoji of the karaoke
example cut from Noto Color Emoji, travels with the bundled examples. Its
license is ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-NotoColorEmoji.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/GrenzeGotisch-lens.ttf, Grenze Gotisch at its bold weight
cut to the masthead of the lens example, travels with the bundled examples.
Its license is ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-GrenzeGotisch.txt.

ghee/examples/fonts/OldStandard-lens.ttf, OldStandard-Bold-lens.ttf and
OldStandard-Italic-lens.ttf, Old Standard TT cut to the words of the lens
example, travel with the bundled examples. Their license is
ghee/examples/fonts/LICENSE-OldStandard.txt.

